"text": "Keep episodes without audio out of the feed list\n\nItems with no <enclosure> made empty rows, and the title fell back to\n\"undefined\" when a feed left it out. Filter them first, and name the\nuntitled ones.\n\nFixes #142.\n\n# Please enter the commit message for your changes. Lines starting\n# with '#' will be ignored, and an empty message aborts the commit.\n#\n# On branch feed-fixes\n# Your branch is up to date with 'origin/feed-fixes'.\n#\n# Changes to be committed:\n#\tmodified:   src/feed.js\n#\tdeleted:    README.md\n#\tnew file:   test/feed.test.js\n#\n# Untracked files:\n#\tnotes.txt\n#\n",
